{
  "name": "New Client Intake to Google Sheets",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8d158709-86b9-492a-b622-2c339f05dbaf",
      "name": "Overview and Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 680,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "# New Client Intake to Google Sheets\n\nCollect client requests in one Google Sheet without creating a duplicate row every time the same person submits the form. This beginner-friendly workflow uses the normalized email address as the unique client key.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Collect Client Intake** receives Name, Email, Company, Service needed, Budget, and Notes.\n2. **Normalize Client Data** trims values, removes repeated spaces, lowercases Email, and adds an ISO timestamp.\n3. **Search Google Sheets by Email** looks for the normalized Email. **Always Output Data** keeps the new-client path working when no row is found.\n4. **Client Exists?** sends a match to **Update Existing Client**. No match goes to **Append New Client**.\n5. The last node returns `Action: updated` or `Action: created` with the normalized client data.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a Google Sheet with this exact header row: `Timestamp`, `Name`, `Email`, `Company`, `Service needed`, `Budget`, `Notes`.\n2. If the sheet already contains clients, make Email values lowercase and ensure each client has only one row.\n3. In the three Google Sheets nodes, connect your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and select the same Document and Sheet.\n4. Keep Email as the search field and update matching column.\n5. Test with a new email, submit it again with changed details, then submit the same email in uppercase. The row count should increase only once.\n\nNo AI, paid API, or community node is required."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0fa59be3-4e6b-482a-8a73-5418df21a70d",
      "name": "Duplicate-Safe Client Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        784,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 2080,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## Duplicate-safe client intake\nNormalize email → search existing rows → update the matching client or append a new row → return a clear created/updated result."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
